% Non-coding computer time: work / study / brain rot; what stood out.
\p{Non-coding computer time is back: the arbtt capture log had silently corrupted and I have since recovered it. The breakdown confirms the worry — of the 25.8 hours tracked, nearly half fall into \strong{Other}, the unclassifiable residual, which is exactly what jumping around too much looks like once a title-only tracker tries to sort it into buckets. I need to be more disciplined with the pomodoro method: choosing something to work on and not diverging \strong{for anything} until the timer has ended.}
